","type":"split","text":"滷汁分成兩鍋，素食那鍋約三分之一。"},{"stage":"veg","type":"cook","text":"素食那鍋：加入碎豆腐，小火煮 15 分鐘到入味、湯汁略收，就是香菇素燥。"},{"stage":"meat","type":"cook","text":"葷食那鍋：另起鍋把豬絞肉炒散炒到出油、微焦，倒入滷汁，小火燉 25 分鐘。"},{"stage":"meat","type":"serve","text":"兩種燥都可以淋在白飯或燙青菜上；隔天更入味。"}],"tags":["allium","meat"],"proteins":["pork","soy"],"source":"builtin"},{"id":"r-braised-tofu-mushroom","name":"紅燒豆腐燒香菇","role":"main","servings":4,"time":25,"method":"braise","vegMode":"nativeVeg","texture":"soft","season":[],"ingredients":[{"food":"R4700901","label":"板豆腐（切厚片）","grams":600,"track":"base"},{"food":"G08001","label":"鮮香菇（切半）","grams":150,"track":"base"},{"food":"E0200101","label":"胡蘿蔔（切片）","grams":80,"track":"base"},{"food":"E1900103","label":"薑片","grams":10,"track":"base"},{"food":"P0700101","label":"醬油","grams":25,"track":"base","pantry":true},{"food":"N0100301","label":"糖","grams":6,"track":"base","pantry":true},{"food":"M1100101","label":"沙拉油","grams":20,"track":"base","pantry":true},{"food":"B0720101","label":"太白粉（勾芡）","grams":6,"track":"base","pantry":true}],"steps":[{"stage":"base","type":"prep","text":"豆腐切約 1.5 公分厚片，用廚房紙巾吸乾表面水分；香菇切半、胡蘿蔔切薄片、薑切片。"},{"stage":"base","type":"cook","text":"平底鍋下油，豆腐兩面煎到金黃後先盛起。"},{"stage":"base","type":"cook","text":"同鍋爆香薑片，下香菇和胡蘿蔔炒一分鐘，加醬油、糖和一碗水煮滾。"},{"stage":"base","type":"cook","text":"豆腐放回鍋中，中小火燒八分鐘讓它吸滿醬汁，最後用太白粉水勾薄芡。"}],"tags":[],"proteins":["soy"],"source":"builtin"},{"id":"r-brown-rice","name":"糙米飯","role":"staple","servings":4,"time":70,"method":"rice","vegMode":"nativeVeg","texture":"normal","season":[],"ingredients":[{"food":"A05013","label":"糙米（生）","grams":320,"track":"base","pantry":true}],"steps":[{"stage":"base","type":"prep","text":"糙米洗淨後泡水至少一小時（趕時間可用溫水泡 40 分鐘），泡過的糙米比較不硬。"},{"stage":"base","type":"prep","text":"加水到米的 1.5 倍，比白米多一些。"},{"stage":"base","type":"cook","text":"電鍋煮好後悶 15 分鐘再翻鬆。牙口較弱的長輩可以改用白米加三分之一糙米混煮。"}],"tags":[],"proteins":[],"source":"builtin"},{"id":"r-cabbage-pork-stirfry","name":"高麗菜炒肉片","role":"main","servings":4,"time":20,"method":